The Testing Grounds

This is not a place with a history. It was built to have one feature of
the game in every room, in the order a new player is likeliest to need
them: movement and looking, doors, picking things up and wearing them,
containers, food and drink, combat, resting, practicing a skill, buying
and selling, banking, renting, mail, and the noticeboard.

Nothing here can hurt you badly. Everything here can be tried more than
once - the whole zone resets itself on a short timer, so a dummy killed
an hour ago is standing again, and a chest opened and emptied fills back
up. Walk north from the start and read each room as you go.
